02:55.270 --> 02:57.770
As expected of the Ryuukyuu kingdom.

02:57.770 --> 03:00.490
It's so magnificent and romantic.

03:00.840 --> 03:02.860
And I ate them sometimes!

03:03.820 --> 03:05.450
A-Ate?!

03:10.960 --> 03:13.460
They do eat dolphins in some areas.

03:13.730 --> 03:16.160
Makio's... dream...

03:18.130 --> 03:19.660
Nice to meet you!

03:19.660 --> 03:21.530
I'm Kise Sanae, a 3rd year student.

03:21.530 --> 03:22.510
Nice to meet you.

03:25.150 --> 03:26.720
N-Nice to meet you.

03:36.760 --> 03:39.150
You have big breasts.

03:39.500 --> 03:42.530
