03:48.560 --> 03:51.520
Both of them are large.

03:53.610 --> 03:56.480
She's Shizuoka Mirei-san, a 2nd year student.

03:57.100 --> 03:59.380
Pleased to meet you.

04:00.460 --> 04:01.510
The guy that can't swim!

04:03.080 --> 04:04.640
Nice to meet you!

04:04.640 --> 04:06.630
M-My name is Okiura Kaname.

04:06.630 --> 04:09.910
