04:28.040 --> 04:30.290
Note: A shirikodama is a ball once thought to be at the mouth of the anus.  The result of having a shirikodama taken out is death.

04:30.790 --> 04:32.410
Shirikodama?

04:34.280 --> 04:37.610
Enough with the stuff about mermaids!

04:37.610 --> 04:39.650
