05:07.910 --> 05:10.010
It's not Ikasama.

05:10.010 --> 05:12.660
It's Ikariya Masa, abbreviated to Ikamasa.

05:15.850 --> 05:17.390
Not good...

05:17.390 --> 05:19.640
