06:00.680 --> 06:05.920
So, we will have a shaving party in honor of our new member.

06:06.370 --> 06:09.680
Now, shave whoever you want without holding back!

06:10.480 --> 06:13.450
Hey, Ikamasa, you better...!

06:14.180 --> 06:15.700
