06:22.050 --> 06:24.820
What's wrong, boys?

06:25.200 --> 06:28.860
It's okay... to shave the girls.

06:37.080 --> 06:40.750
Wow... The boys turned into a mob.

06:41.910 --> 06:43.760
Kaname,

06:43.760 --> 06:46.360
you are a manager, right?

06:46.360 --> 06:48.130
It'd be pointless if you don't shave.

06:48.130 --> 06:50.180
