06:51.260 --> 06:52.370
There.

06:52.370 --> 06:53.640
That's your target.

06:53.990 --> 06:55.410
Stay still.

06:55.410 --> 06:57.680
No, thank you! No, thank you!

06:59.990 --> 07:02.020
